<symbol type="4" id="56" code="301.3" name="Uncrossable body of water (dominant), fill"><description>An area of deep water such as a lake, pond, river or fountain. The dark blue colour and the bordering black line indicate that the feature shall not be crossed.
Dominant areas of water may be shown with 70% colour.
Minimum width: 0.3 mm
Minimum area (inside): 0.5 mm² (footprint 8 m²)</description><area_symbol inner_color="17" min_area="1000" patterns="0"/>
